<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mod panel</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/img/favicon3.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
  <script src="/js/theme-rice.js"></script>
  <script>
    try { if (window.CoolbradorRice && window.CoolbradorRice.earlyBoot) window.CoolbradorRice.earlyBoot(); } catch (e) {}
  </script>
  <style>
    .mod-wrap { width: min(980px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: 28px auto 80px; }
    .mod-wrap h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.75rem; }
    .mod-sub { color: var(--cb-muted); margin: 0 0 18px; }
    .mod-card, .mod-gate-card {
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-surface) 92%, transparent);
      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-accent) 28%, transparent);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .mod-card-head { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .mod-pfp { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; background: var(--cb-surface); }
    .mod-muted { color: var(--cb-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .mod-card label, .mod-gate-card label {
      display: block; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--cb-muted);
    }
    .mod-card input, .mod-card textarea, .mod-gate-card input, #modBoardSelect, #modHydrateBoard {
      display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 6px; box-sizing: border-box;
      border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-text) 18%, transparent);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-bg) 70%, transparent); color: inherit; padding: 10px 12px; font: inherit;
    }
    .mod-card textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 88px; }
    .mod-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .mod-btn {
      border: none; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
      background: var(--cb-accent); color: var(--cb-on-accent, #fff);
    }
    .mod-btn-danger {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-danger, #f66) 80%, transparent);
      color: var(--cb-danger, #f66);
    }
    .mod-btn.ghost, .mod-tabs .mod-tab {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-accent) 45%, transparent);
      color: inherit;
    }
    .mod-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
    .mod-tab { border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; }
    .mod-tab.active { background: var(--cb-accent); color: var(--cb-on-accent, #fff); border-color: transparent; }
    #modStatus { min-height: 1.2em; margin: 8px 0 16px; color: var(--cb-muted); }
    #modStatus.is-error { color: var(--cb-danger, #f66); }
    .mod-empty { color: var(--cb-muted); }
    .mod-toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; align-items: center; }
    .mod-file input { margin-top: 6px; }
    .mod-badge {
      display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px; vertical-align: middle;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-accent) 28%, transparent);
      color: var(--cb-accent);
    }
    .mod-media-preview {
      margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-accent) 35%, transparent);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-bg) 55%, transparent);
    }
    .mod-media-preview img, .mod-media-preview video {
      display: block; max-width: 220px; max-height: 140px; border-radius: 10px; object-fit: cover;
    }
    .mod-media-empty { color: var(--cb-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .mod-hydrate {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-end; margin: 12px 0;
      padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--cb-accent) 22%, transparent);
    }
    .mod-hydrate label { flex: 1 1 180px; margin: 0; }
    .mod-note { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--cb-muted); margin: 0 0 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="mod-page">
  <div id="shared-header"></div>
  <main class="mod-wrap">
    <h1>Mod panel</h1>
    <p class="mod-sub">Edit display names, usernames, profile pictures, post text, and post media (image/video URL or upload) on this device. Fake demo Labradors (BeeSid, Chipper, GyattToad, CoolDog, LabPuppy, and friends) are always listed, even when they only appear as post authors.</p>
    <p id="modStatus"></p>

    <section id="modGate" class="mod-gate-card">
      <h2>Unlock</h2>
      <p class="mod-muted">Default PIN is <code>coolbrador</code>. You can change it after unlock.</p>
      <label>PIN<input id="modPin" type="password" autocomplete="current-password"></label>
      <div class="mod-actions">
        <button type="button" class="mod-btn" data-act="unlock">Unlock</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="modApp" hidden>
      <div class="mod-toolbar">
        <button type="button" class="mod-btn ghost" data-act="refresh">Refresh</button>
        <button type="button" class="mod-btn ghost" data-act="set-pin">Change PIN</button>
        <button type="button" class="mod-btn ghost" data-act="add-me-mod">Add my account as mod</button>
        <a class="mod-btn ghost" href="/settings.html" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;">Settings</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mod-tabs" role="tablist">
        <button type="button" class="mod-tab active" data-tab="users">Users</button>
        <button type="button" class="mod-tab" data-tab="posts">Posts</button>
      </div>

      <div id="modUsersPane">
        <p class="mod-note">Demo users are seeded into <code>user_*</code> / <code>profile_*</code> if missing. Saving updates those keys and rewrites matching posts by userId and by username.</p>
        <div id="modUsersList"></div>
      </div>

      <div id="modPostsPane" hidden>
        <p class="mod-note">Edits stay on this device until you Publish. Publish replaces the live Chipper feed on the server (old posts deleted).</p>
        <p class="mod-note">Edits write to <code>posts_/b/BoardName</code> in localStorage (BeeSid / beesid variants supported; the fuller key wins). If BeeSid looks empty, load the demo board JSON first so Save has a real key to update.</p>
        <label class="mod-muted">Board
          <select id="modBoardSelect"></select>
        </label>
        <div class="mod-hydrate">
          <label class="mod-muted">Load demo board into localStorage
            <input id="modHydrateBoard" value="BeeSid" placeholder="BeeSid">
          </label>
          <button type="button" class="mod-btn" data-act="load-demo-board">Load demo board</button>
          <button type="button" class="mod-btn" data-act="publish-chipper-feed">Publish to Chipper feed</button>
        </div>
        <p class="mod-note">Publish uploads your current BeeSid board to the live Chipper feed and deletes the previous live posts. Chipper reads → <code>/data/boards/</code>).</p>
        <div id="modPostsList" style="margin-top:12px;"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <div id="shared-footer"></div>
  <script src="/js/layout.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/mod-panel.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
